                                "sense_id": "b6fea996-0894-38e1-8dab-2f45a85c9ab1",
                                "text": "Wir haben verloren, weil wir in der zweiten Halbzeit in der Minderzahl waren.",
                                "translation": "We lost because we were outnumbered in the second half.",
                                "english": "We lost because we were outnumbered in the second half."
