                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e087783-f373-4ebb-a1e0-56bf917cf1f4",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd23bf44-e8f8-3e11-b407-7dbf6fcf2c26",
                        "source_sense_id": "b37dbabc-d855-3dde-adeb-a14204f33294",
                        "source_sense_description": "der kleinere Teil einer Menge",
                        "target_lang_word": "minority",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "minority",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "988fd51f-d1f3-36a1-b2f7-ac59fb958a64",
                                        "entry_id": "3e7adbb5-325e-3a67-817f-21ff6f954ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being a minor; youth, the period of a person's life prior to reaching adulthood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e444b94e-c7b1-4af7-a826-2f26434f015c",
                                                "sense_id": "988fd51f-d1f3-36a1-b2f7-ac59fb958a64",
                                                "text": "And lest any man should think her intent was to unnestle ill neighbours, and not to aid good neighbours, or that she was readier to restore what was invaded by others than to render what was in her own hands; see if the time provided not a new occasion afterwards, when through their own division, without the intermise of strangers, her forces were again sought and required; she forsook them not, prevailed so far as to be possessed of the castle of Edinburgh, the principal strength of that kingdom, with peace, incontinently, without cunctations or cavillations, the preambles of a wavering faith, she rendered with all honour and security; and his person to safe and faithful hands; and so ever after during his minority continued his principal guardian and protector."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0739453-5e90-4948-8341-5bb381f2bb94",
                                                "sense_id": "988fd51f-d1f3-36a1-b2f7-ac59fb958a64",
                                                "text": "She also played a key role as dowager-regent during the minority of her son."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43455ed6-5736-31d8-a690-23e2f0c8b138",
                                        "entry_id": "3e7adbb5-325e-3a67-817f-21ff6f954ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any subgroup that does not form a numerical majority."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1731e39-c63e-42b3-bb1c-e03425843397",
                                                "sense_id": "43455ed6-5736-31d8-a690-23e2f0c8b138",
                                                "text": "Most people agreed, but a sizable minority were upset by the decision."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0c0420d-0c0c-4cec-9b42-330d1aefbda9",
                                                "sense_id": "43455ed6-5736-31d8-a690-23e2f0c8b138",
                                                "text": "The case is the latest chapter in a decade-long struggle by the nation's elite minority to crush the powerful political machine founded by Yingluck's brother, Thaksin Shinawatra, who was toppled in another coup in 2006."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eca855e-826d-386b-943c-1c5db8d166fb",
                                        "entry_id": "3e7adbb5-325e-3a67-817f-21ff6f954ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of an ethnic minority."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd1b8cba-0632-42fb-97ea-f389c2e4f12b",
                                                "sense_id": "1eca855e-826d-386b-943c-1c5db8d166fb",
                                                "text": "The company claims it has hired several minorities since the complaint was lodged."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb030188-e9b7-375f-9e03-c59ca68e6719",
                                        "entry_id": "3e7adbb5-325e-3a67-817f-21ff6f954ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of people seen as distinct who are subordinated and discriminated against in a society."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98a453d5-abd9-4335-9d07-7b7b92b53ceb",
                                                "sense_id": "fb030188-e9b7-375f-9e03-c59ca68e6719",
                                                "text": "But we have seen that one important difference between women and other minorities is that women's attitudes and self-conceptions are conditioned more largely by interaction with both minority and dominant group members"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a68032bb-f9f2-3e94-ade1-40f6af2de4a4",
                                        "entry_id": "3e7adbb5-325e-3a67-817f-21ff6f954ec9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Muslim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India",
                                            "countable",
                                            "euphemistic",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "minority",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62db0161-afc9-3216-acdf-6cf560ac1d0d",
                                        "entry_id": "73fd82fa-bc1d-361f-9f16-3cd474a025d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to a minority."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "relational"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5280d537-ec5d-41da-90d2-4b58d87eea46",
                                                "sense_id": "62db0161-afc9-3216-acdf-6cf560ac1d0d",
                                                "text": "They hold a minority interest in the company."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ee13dc2-900e-309a-a11f-026234847d7b",
                                        "entry_id": "73fd82fa-bc1d-361f-9f16-3cd474a025d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Empowered by or representing a minority (usually a plurality) of votes cast, legislative seats, etc., rather than an outright majority thereof."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63995cb7-a625-43b8-87ad-4d948b1e46da",
                                                "sense_id": "8ee13dc2-900e-309a-a11f-026234847d7b",
                                                "text": "minority government"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "822a1101-9261-4dc6-bc1a-30d07893c70f",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd23bf44-e8f8-3e11-b407-7dbf6fcf2c26",
                        "source_sense_id": "b37dbabc-d855-3dde-adeb-a14204f33294",
                        "source_sense_description": "der kleinere Teil einer Menge",
                        "target_lang_word": "minorité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "minorité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9d4787f-263c-3ccf-8850-0623a611c047",
                                        "entry_id": "45e1f555-8f3b-3bd5-8252-ac0cd17f5217",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Le petit nombre, par opposition à majorité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d0acb3e-ae1e-4b63-ae4a-e9cd54438404",
                                                "sense_id": "e9d4787f-263c-3ccf-8850-0623a611c047",
                                                "text": "L’acquiescence active ou passive d'un vaste nombre d’Allemands au nazisme, la facile soumission de tous, sauf d'une brave et infime minorité, sont des faits d'une profonde signification historique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98391007-5755-46fd-b504-cbc799d7870f",
                                                "sense_id": "e9d4787f-263c-3ccf-8850-0623a611c047",
                                                "text": "C'est ce qui permit à une minorité conquérante, politiquement et socialement dominante, de populations surtout chrétiennes, païennes et zoroastriennes, de consolider l'Islam et de soumettre rapidement les mondes sémitiques et iranien."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73e16d46-0e60-435f-bc96-c61f3e02195c",
                                                "sense_id": "e9d4787f-263c-3ccf-8850-0623a611c047",
                                                "text": "Au nom de la bien-pensance, des groupes et des partis politiques instillent des interdits qui chamboulent notre démocratie alors que la voix des minorités devient plus tonitruante que celle de la majorité."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b3111ee-7e84-3c3c-8ea5-311a254ff402",
                                        "entry_id": "45e1f555-8f3b-3bd5-8252-ac0cd17f5217",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie la moins nombreuse d’une assemblée, qui combat certaines opinions, certaines mesures préférées par la partie la plus nombreuse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e248c9fb-52b7-4afc-a8ff-5506922c91e4",
                                                "sense_id": "9b3111ee-7e84-3c3c-8ea5-311a254ff402",
                                                "text": "Un député, un orateur de la minorité. — La minorité a gagné quelques voix."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2812c7ed-2dd1-47b2-81df-7e8a17ca53df",
                                                "sense_id": "9b3111ee-7e84-3c3c-8ea5-311a254ff402",
                                                "text": "Sans remonter à l’événement traumatique fondateur que furent les massacres de la Saint-Barthélemy, on rappellera que la minorité réformée fut l'objet, sous Louis XIV, d'un « mémoricide » sans précédent : […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "357163a3-5043-340e-94de-d070b770056a",
                                        "entry_id": "45e1f555-8f3b-3bd5-8252-ac0cd17f5217",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État d’une personne mineure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48ab3547-2664-4206-bb4e-68058e09f591",
                                                "sense_id": "357163a3-5043-340e-94de-d070b770056a",
                                                "text": "Le privilège de la minorité est de faire déclarer nuls tous les actes que le mineur a faits à son préjudice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03153ce1-6395-473f-9cdb-4834391d9922",
                                                "sense_id": "357163a3-5043-340e-94de-d070b770056a",
                                                "text": "M. d’Orsel nous traitait tous comme des enfants, y compris sa fille aînée, que par un calcul de tendresse il se plaisait à rajeunir encore et remettait en minorité par des noms qui rappelaient le couvent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51540a2b-5916-388f-9042-abbae0e2955e",
                                        "entry_id": "45e1f555-8f3b-3bd5-8252-ac0cd17f5217",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Minorité des souverains ou temps qu’a duré cette minorité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2f1ce97-64b2-4314-8096-37537612fc8f",
                                                "sense_id": "51540a2b-5916-388f-9042-abbae0e2955e",
                                                "text": "Pendant la minorité de Louis XIV. — Les minorités sont ordinairement des temps de troubles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4be4f2cb-b695-3b6d-ab6c-0fdfb641c10b",
                                        "entry_id": "45e1f555-8f3b-3bd5-8252-ac0cd17f5217",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Groupe social dominé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd763756-d99a-4455-ae99-c3332a33dc97",
                                                "sense_id": "4be4f2cb-b695-3b6d-ab6c-0fdfb641c10b",
                                                "text": "Antitotalitaire, antiraciste, attentif au sort des minorités, il prônait une révolution continentale contre les nationalismes et les oligarchies économiques pour aboutir à la construction, une fois le IIIe Reich vaincu, d’une Europe unifiée et démocratique dotée de sa propre armée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33c085c5-b143-459b-a7e1-de0c65990c79",
                                                "sense_id": "4be4f2cb-b695-3b6d-ab6c-0fdfb641c10b",
                                                "text": "Osons le dire : au sein de minorités sexuelles, les femmes prennent le pouvoir. Elles le font plutôt par la bisexualité que par l'homosexualité. Le drapeau arc-en-ciel ne doit pas nous cacher que le bloc historique LGBT est passé en matridominance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb87f581-6ab2-44d1-ae12-d635b99e1922",
                                                "sense_id": "4be4f2cb-b695-3b6d-ab6c-0fdfb641c10b",
                                                "text": "L’usage abusif du terme de racisme pour qualifier de réels comportements hostiles de minoritaires à l’encontre de majoritaires renvoie à une confusion dans la définition des termes de « majorité » et de « minorité ». Ceux-ci ne désignent pas une réalité quantitative, mais une réalité qualitative. Les femmes sont une minorité sociologique bien qu’elles soient la majorité démographique."
                                            },
                                            {
